scripts.text:
[Priest Dayan]
{0}
Through the Holy Pilgrimage, we can make ourselves pious by cleansing our bodies and souls.

scripts.translation:
[牧師 達揚]
{0}
通過神聖朝聖，我們可以淨化身心，使自己變得虔誠。

scripts.text:
[Priest Dayan]
{0}
Now, there is a place you should go to.

scripts.translation:
[牧師 達揚]
{0}
現在，有一個你應該去的地方。
